<title>USA: Akron General Medical buys 3 Ohio facilities.</title>
<headline>Akron General Medical buys 3 Ohio facilities.</headline>
<dateline>AKRON, Ohio 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Akron General Medical Center said Wednesday it acquired three Medical Mutual of Ohio health maintenance facilities in Akron, Fairlawn and Stow.</p>
<p>The purchase price was not disclosed.</p>
<p>As part of the deal, 14 HMO Health Ohio physicians have been asked to join Akron General's Network Health Group subsidiary of physician practices.</p>
<p>Both Akron General and Medical Mutual are not-for-profit organizations.</p>
</text>
